# Project Task Learning

This directory stores project-local structured experience data produced by EREI Engineering Framework execution.

Canonical runtime-created files:

```text
TASK_EVENTS.jsonl       append-only task learning events
LEARNING_REVIEWS.jsonl  append-only closed learning reviews
LEARNING_STATE.json     derived current epoch/metrics/trigger
LEARNING_SUMMARY.md     derived human-readable state
```

Every routed engineering execution should create one terminal Task Learning Event, including successful, blocked and failed work. Explanation-only conversation that never enters engineering execution is not recorded.

Task learning is not Framework Feedback. Most successful task events will have no Framework Feedback. Feedback is linked only when evidence suggests a Framework limitation or reusable lesson.

Do not store chain-of-thought, credentials, customer payloads or unrelated conversation content here. Store structured engineering signals and durable evidence references.

Review triggers are deterministic and do not authorize Framework self-modification. Framework-changing findings must follow Framework Feedback → Knowledge Promotion → normal Candidate/Stable governance.
